## Done when

- Valid credentials → main UI; invalid/locked/deactivated → generic error on Login.
- Logout works; refresh requires login.
- Lockout after configured failed attempts (`login_failure_threshold`, default 3).
- `session_timeout_minutes` stored in Admin (not enforced).
- QA checklist delivered; finish-up only on request.

